        "path": "README.md",
        "char_start": 282,
        "char_end": 672,
        "byte_start": 282,
        "byte_end": 672,
        "text": "**One owner returns; two stop; none refuses.** This is the ownership rule:\none eligible owner may return its page, competing owners stop for ambiguity,\nand no eligible owner means refusal. A returned page is not automatically a\nsupported answer. Strict answering additionally checks eligible source wording\nunder the finite proof rules. Source integrity does not establish historical truth."
      },
